    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1915, the Life‑Saving Service Station Grand Marais became part of the U.S. Coast Guard, later turning its keeper’s quarters into the Grand Marais Maritime Museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        15,
        16,
