      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Marais%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A narrow‑gauge Manistique Railroad once hauled logs to Grand Marais, and when the tracks were removed in 1910 the boom town shrank dramatically.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
